I continue through the supermarket.
By a little table stands a woman.
She offers a free taste.
"Do you want to taste our liquorice?" the woman asks.
"Yes please," I say.
I take a small piece.
I eat it.
I pull a face.
It is very salty!
It is real Danish salt liquorice.
"Do you like it?" the woman asks and smiles.
The liquorice is very strong.
"No..."
"I don't like it!" I say.
I laugh out loud.
Salt liquorice is not for me.
But it is a fun experience.
